    "Id": "chassisdef_nanook_NNK-2",
    "Name": "Nanook",
    "Details": "The Nanook 2 combines the inherent strength of laser weapons on its platform with two Streak LRM-20 launchers. The increased indirect fire capabilities over the NNK-1 improves the performance of the 'Mech on the battlefield considerably.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Cooling Jacket - Laser</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.42</color></b>",
