  "StockRole": "Superheavy Brawler",
  "YangsThoughts": "When Clan Ghost Bear needed a superheavy 'Mech, they took the basic Kodiak concepts and created the Nanook. A 160 ton beast of a 'Mech, fully armored and surprisingly fast thanks to its 460 XXL engine, it is meant to out-manuever other superheavies before dealing a full on alpha strike. Worth noticing is that the way the internal circuitry of the Nanook is set up, it heavily favours Laser weapons.",
